/* HRM SYSTEM – supplemental development fixtures for dbo schema, SQL Server 2016+
   RUN AFTER create_database(1).sql, on NON-PRODUCTION COPY ONLY.
   Safe additive seed: guards by unique business codes and NEVER truncates/deletes/updates existing rows.
   Passwords: all newly created accounts are DISABLED; replace with properly generated hashes through backend admin flow.
   Payroll values are illustrative TEST FIXTURES (DEMO_ONLY), not a legal or approved payroll policy.
   All audit timestamps are UTC; schedule times are Vietnam local wall-clock as in source schema.
*/
USE [hrm_db];
GO
